// Windows resources for the executable (compiled by windres via CMake, WIN32 only).
// SDL2 uses the first icon in the .exe as the window-class icon, so the taskbar button gets
// the right icon from the moment the window is created, instead of depending on the main
// thread answering WM_GETICON during startup (SDL_SetWindowIcon arrives later).
// Regenerate application.ico from assets/icons/application.png if the icon changes.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "application.ico"
